   146|        <div class="seal">DAO</div>
   147|        <h1>Destiny Brief</h1>
   148|        <div class="subtitle">A concise reading with a recommended jewelry direction</div>
   149|        <div class="meta">
   150|            <strong>Prepared for:</strong> Alex Chen<br>
   151|            <strong>Date of Birth:</strong> May 15, 1990 at 11:42 AM<br>
   152|            <strong>Birth Location:</strong> Los Angeles, California, USA<br>
   153|            <strong>Report Date:</strong> April 15, 2026
   154|        </div>
